mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/74d53b4dc03a7c262d76f02174f2dcc4.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Run after run, you’ll access more and more upgrades and tactical choices, but firepower alone won’t save you from the denizens of the depths. Mastering <i>Abyssus</i>'s visceral gunplay and fast-paced action will require tactical coordination, positioning skills, and cohesive teamwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46e14dc13ca2bf254a855264393fe8c5.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46e14dc13ca2bf254a855264393fe8c5.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46e14dc13ca2bf254a855264393fe8c5.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46c1f1c163df3e4c010aa6fe50e0646b.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46c1f1c163df3e4c010aa6fe50e0646b.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46c1f1c163df3e4c010aa6fe50e0646b.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world of <i>Abyssus</i> is richly atmospheric and steeped in mystery. What untold secrets lie in the sunken kingdom? What gives brine its inexplicable powers? Can we weaponize an anglerfish? The answers lie deep down below… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/39c2089ed93de4bb29916481e8b46901.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/39c2089ed93de4bb29916481e8b46901.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/39c2089ed93de4bb29916481e8b46901.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/3fdfc07c02577446b8ab85c14b6ac96a.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/3fdfc07c02577446b8ab85c14b6ac96a.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/3fdfc07c02577446b8ab85c14b6ac96a.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visceral, fast-paced FPS action, with top-notch weapon feel and combat responsiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4-players co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite meta progression with advancements, rewards, and unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ hand-crafted levels, procedurally sequenced to make every run a new experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different weapons customizable with 45 weapon mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 140 Ancient Forge mods to further empower weapons and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive pre-run and in-run character customization options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 different enemies and 12 bosses that will put your skills to the challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 250 Charms and Blessings to craft the perfect build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/b4c7644edec06d031c232b40657f68f0.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/b4c7644edec06d031c232b40657f68f0.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/b4c7644edec06d031c232b40657f68f0.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
